{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e13-scene-07",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "这首歌无偿赠给我们  (She Gifted This New Song to Us for Free)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In a devastating one-two punch, Wen Simo goes live to expose the publisher's years of unpaid royalties and void contract, right as Chun Yuqiao steps into the conference room with a gifted new song from the songwriter. Listen to Wen Simo, Chun Yuqiao, and Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这首歌曲的侵权事件前几天闹得沸沸扬扬，可是现在却有了一个戏剧性的转变。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "原来这家振振有词控诉别人侵权的白石音乐公司，多年拖欠词曲作者钟阳子的版权收益！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "从法律层面上来讲，这家公司已经违约在先了，所以他们手中的这份合约已经失效。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "更让人想不到的是，星天娱乐竟然拿到了钟阳子的亲笔授权书，并将代表她反诉白石音乐公司！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "十二歌王第二期今晚录影，今天晚上我们会推出一首新歌，作者是钟阳子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "钟小姐特别把这首歌和授权书专门托人带给我们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她说为了表示对星天公司和淳于乔先生的谢意，这首歌无偿赠给我们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我想问一问，贵公司是否认为单凭你们在海外娱乐产业发达的经验和资源，",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "就一定能够征服有数千年文化情感的东方观众？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "收拾什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我还有点工作没做完，晚上正好也有约了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "桌上的东西你可以看看。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这首歌曲的侵权事件前几天闹得沸沸扬扬，可是现在却有了一个戏剧性的转变。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The copyright uproar around this song raged for days, yet now it has taken a dramatic turn.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "原来这家振振有词控诉别人侵权的白石音乐公司，多年拖欠词曲作者钟阳子的版权收益！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It turns out Baishi Music, so self-righteous in suing others, has withheld royalties from songwriter Zhong Yangzi for years!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "从法律层面上来讲，这家公司已经违约在先了，所以他们手中的这份合约已经失效。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Legally speaking, the publisher breached its contract first, rendering the agreement in its hands null and void.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "更让人想不到的是，星天娱乐竟然拿到了钟阳子的亲笔授权书，并将代表她反诉白石音乐公司！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even more astonishing, Xingtian Entertainment has obtained Zhong Yangzi's handwritten authorization and will countersue Baishi on her behalf!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "十二歌王第二期今晚录影，今天晚上我们会推出一首新歌，作者是钟阳子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Episode Two of Twelve Singers tapes tonight, and this evening we will debut a brand-new song written by Zhong Yangzi.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "钟小姐特别把这首歌和授权书专门托人带给我们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ms Zhong specially entrusted a messenger to bring both this new song and her authorization letter to us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她说为了表示对星天公司和淳于乔先生的谢意，这首歌无偿赠给我们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To express her gratitude to Xingtian and to me, she gifted this song to us completely free of charge.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我想问一问，贵公司是否认为单凭你们在海外娱乐产业发达的经验和资源，",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me ask you one question: does your group truly believe that relying solely on your overseas entertainment experience and resources.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "就一定能够征服有数千年文化情感的东方观众？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'is enough to win over Eastern audiences shaped by thousands of years of cultural emotion?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "收拾什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why are we packing up our desks?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我还有点工作没做完，晚上正好也有约了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I still have a bit of work to finish, and I already have plans for tonight anyway.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "桌上的东西你可以看看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Take a look at the folder I left on your desk.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这首歌曲的侵权事件前几天闹得沸沸扬扬，可是现在却有了一个戏剧性的转变。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "原来这家振振有词控诉别人侵权的白石音乐公司，多年拖欠词曲作者钟阳子的版权收益！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "从法律层面上来讲，这家公司已经违约在先了，所以他们手中的这份合约已经失效。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "更让人想不到的是，星天娱乐竟然拿到了钟阳子的亲笔授权书，并将代表她反诉白石音乐公司！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "十二歌王第二期今晚录影，今天晚上我们会推出一首新歌，作者是钟阳子。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "钟小姐特别把这首歌和授权书专门托人带给我们。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她说为了表示对星天公司和淳于乔先生的谢意，这首歌无偿赠给我们。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我想问一问，贵公司是否认为单凭你们在海外娱乐产业发达的经验和资源，",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "就一定能够征服有数千年文化情感的东方观众？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "收拾什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我还有点工作没做完，晚上正好也有约了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "桌上的东西你可以看看。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Leaving the humbled foreign representative speechless over whether overseas industry formulas alone can conquer Chinese audiences, Yuqiao drops his confidential original show plan on Xiaogu's desk while the team heads out to celebrate. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
